          "Migration cases": [
            "Migration cases are cases related to foreign nationals and citizenship, and they are handled by the Migration Court of Appeal at the Administrative Court of Appeal in Stockholm. In some years, a few migration cases also appear in another administrative court of appeal even if it is not the Migration Court of Appeal. In 2006, the migration courts and the Migration Court of Appeal were established as lower and higher instances in migration cases."
